Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.15,0:00:45.00,Tagline,,0,0,0,,Smarter Flood Awareness. Safer Communities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:02.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,Residents can access ClimateTwin AI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.72,0:00:04.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,instantly, without signing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.25,0:00:06.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,Clear warnings help residents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.98,0:00:09.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,understand changing flood conditions
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.13,0:00:10.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,near their homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.25,0:00:13.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,The interactive map shows an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.93,0:00:15.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,available shelter route, with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.66,0:00:17.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,estimated walking time and distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.25,0:00:24.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,As simulated flooding develops, road
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.59,0:00:26.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,conditions update automatically,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.67,0:00:29.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,helping residents identify available
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.02,0:00:29.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,routes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.25,0:00:34.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,Residents can also see current water
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.45,0:00:36.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,levels and AI predictions for the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.46,0:00:38.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,next ten and twenty minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.25,0:00:42.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,ClimateTwin AI helps communities
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.57,0:00:43.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,prepare earlier.
